  "result": "I fixed the export in `src/lib/csv.ts:10`. The check that decides whether a field needs quotes looked for commas and line breaks but not double quotes. A title with a quote in it was written out bare, so the spreadsheet read that quote as the start of a quoted field and shifted the columns. Commas were already covered, which is why those titles came out fine.\n\nThe check now includes double quotes, so those titles are wrapped in quotes with each inner quote doubled, as the CSV standard requires. The same file also builds the audit-log (activity) export, which may have had the same problem. I haven't run the tests.",
